[{"id":165435991,"discussion_id":"97d915ec83b1395cc08d41fa559fc0e130d961ca","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8B%E6%96%B9%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E8%A1%A8%E6%A0%BC)。\nYou can get sig-info at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/community/blob/master/CANN/sigs/ops-nn/sig-info.yaml)\n\n\n---\n\n## PR Approval Progress\n\n✅ **Congratulations! All modules have met the lgtm and approve requirements.**\n\n### Module Approval Details\n\n| module | lgtm status | approve status |\n|------|-----------|--------------|\n| matmul | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317), [*fanqirui*](https://gitcode.com/fanqirui) (2/2) | ✅ [*chenqi317*](https://gitcode.com/chenqi317) (1/1) |\n\n> \uD83D\uDCA1 Tip:\n> - **Committer** can comment `/approve` or `/lgtm`\n> - Commenting `/approve` implies both code review (lgtm) and intent to merge (approve)\n\n------\n\n## CLA Signature Pass  \n xubinglin, thanks for your pull request. All authors of the commits have signed the CLA. :+1:","created_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:12+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-24T14:42:56+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165436005,"discussion_id":"56901437330420ed83d61b280eb984106f3c1735","body":":large_blue_circle: source code change are detected, tasks labels is removed in this pull request!","created_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:19+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:19+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165436020,"discussion_id":"67567658fa1c2f46a5f81dddca693454c0f495b5","body":"<div style='font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.2;'><div style='font-size: 13px; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 4px;'>逻辑错误: 代码第40行存在一个潜在的错误。在修改前的版本中，`stepKb` 被错误地赋值为 `tiling->matmulTiling.stepKa`，这会导致 `stepKb` 和 `stepKa` 使用相同的值，这可能不符合算法的预期逻辑。修改后的版本将其更正为 `tiling->matmulTiling.stepKb`。然而，结合第46行代码 `AscendC::MakeShape(baseM, baseN, stepKa * baseK, stepKb * baseK)` 来看，`stepKa` 和 `stepKb` 被分别用于计算形状的第三和第四个维度。如果 `stepKa` 和 `stepKb` 在原始设计中应有不同的含义（例如，分别对应矩阵A和矩阵B在K维度上的分块步长），那么修改前的错误赋值会导致计算出的形状维度错误，进而可能引发后续的内存访问越界、数据错位或计算错误。修改是正确的，它修复了这个逻辑错误。</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>问题类型</strong>: 逻辑错误</div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>文件路径</strong>: <code style='font-size: 11px;'>matmul/quant_batch_matmul_v4/op_kernel/arch35/cmct/prologue/block_prologue_b_cast_scsc_nn.h</code></div><div style='margin: 1px 0;'><strong>行号</strong>: 40</div><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>问题代码</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f5f5f5; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 2px; overflow-x: auto;'>auto stepKb = static_cast<uint32_t>(tiling->matmulTiling.stepKb);</pre><div style='margin: 3px 0 1px 0; font-size: 11px;'><strong>修改建议</strong>:</div><pre style='margin: 1px 0; padding: 2px 4px; font-size: 10px; background: #f0f8ff; border: 1px solid #cce0ff; border-radius: 2px;'>确认修改是正确的。建议在代码审查中确认 `stepKa` 和 `stepKb` 在 `QuantBatchMatmulV4TilingDataParams` 结构体中的定义和预期用途，确保它们分别代表正确的分块参数。此外，检查所有使用 `stepKa` 和 `stepKb` 的地方，确保没有其他类似的拷贝粘贴错误。</pre><div style='margin-top: 4px; font-size: 9px; color: #999;'>---<br>此评论由代码审查工具自动生成</div></div>","created_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:37+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-24T19:46:35+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"diff_comment","resolved":true,"resolved_by":{"id":"6881fd955294102de27f353b","login":"xubinglin","object_id":"6881fd955294102de27f353b","name":"xubinglin","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xubinglin"},"diff_position":{"start_new_line":40,"end_new_line":40,"start_old_line":40,"end_old_line":40,"position_type":"text"}},{"id":165436029,"discussion_id":"19ed9383312394f987cf36734dcee7df0027975a","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复量化批量矩阵乘法算子中，块矩阵乘累加和B矩阵预处理两个关键组件的代码缺陷。原错误导致用于B矩阵K维度分块的步长参数`stepKb`被错误地赋值为`stepKa`，可能影响算子内部的分块计算逻辑和内存访问模式，从而引发计算错误或性能下降。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修正了两个文件中`ToUnderlyingArguments`函数内的变量赋值错误。具体修改是将从`tiling`结构体中获取`stepKb`值的代码，从错误的`tiling->matmulTiling.stepKa`统一更正为正确的`tiling->matmulTiling.stepKb`。此修改确保了算子能够正确读取和使用B矩阵的分块步长参数，从而保证了计算逻辑的正确性。","created_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:46+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-16T22:02:46+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165832006,"discussion_id":"2efdbc44380f501c4283c847b24f53532f4436cc","body":"/compile","created_at":"2026-03-20T09:15:55+08:00","updated_at":"2026-03-20T09:15:55+08:00","user":{"id":"6881fd955294102de27f353b","login":"xubinglin","object_id":"6881fd955294102de27f353b","name":"xubinglin","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/xubinglin"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":165832165,"discussion_id":"25c3c9781d6bef055b490d99a6d50f12ba7899e3","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='